  "metadata": {
    "title": "FourCastNet V2: 10-day hindcasts of 100-m u and v winds (2022-10 to 2023-03)",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14793629",
    "publication_date": "2025-02-03",
    "description": "<p>These hindcasts are initialised daily using ERA5. They have global coverage at 0.25&deg; horizontal resolution and six-hourly output frequency.<br><br>Files are in grib format. Filenames are of the form YYYYMMDD-hhh-vvvvvv.grib, where YYYY-MM-DD is the initialisation date, hhh is the lead time in hours, and vvvvvv is the variable grib code (228246 for u100, 228247 for v100).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>v1.1 includes some files that were missing in v1.0 (forecasts initialised Oct 1 to Oct 5).</li>\n</ul>",
